meta {
  name: 03 Viewable Patients
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/patient-portal/patients
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{patientAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  The patients this session may view in the active lab: the logged-in person's own
  record(s) first (`isSelf: true`, `relationship: "SELF"`), then the family members
  linked to them (staff-managed `PatientFamilyLink`; a family member is a patient
  row with no login of its own, so only the head can see them). Feeds the portal's
  "Viewing" dropdown; every patient-portal list/detail/PDF read is limited to
  exactly these patients.

  Response `data`: `[{ patientId, name, relationship, isSelf }]`

  Requires a patient JWT; on a temp-password session returns `403
  PATIENT_PASSWORD_CHANGE_REQUIRED`.
}
